#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:2
msgid "Host Maintenance & Evacuation"
msgstr "Manutenção e Evacuação de Host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:7
msgid ""
"Host maintenance mode allows administrators to take a host offline for "
"servicing (hardware repair, OS patching, firmware updates) without "
"triggering unnecessary VM failover. When a host enters maintenance mode, "
"|morpheus| evacuates VMs to other cluster hosts via live migration before"
" marking the host offline."
msgstr "O modo de manutenção de host permite que administradores tirem um host offline para manutenção (reparo de hardware, patch do SO, atualizações de firmware) sem acionar failover desnecessário de VMs. Quando um host entra no modo de manutenção, o |morpheus| evacua as VMs para outros hosts do cluster via live migration antes de marcar o host como offline."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:9
msgid ""
"This procedure evacuates a Host. To evacuate VM disks from a datastore "
"that is being serviced or retired, use datastore maintenance mode in "
":doc:`storage_operations`."
msgstr "Este procedimento evacua um Host. Para evacuar discos de VM de um datastore que está sendo mantido ou desativado, use o modo de manutenção de datastore em :doc:`storage_operations`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:12
msgid "Entering Maintenance Mode"
msgstr "Entrando no Modo de Manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:15
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:90
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Procedimento"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:17
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:92
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Hosts``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Hosts``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:18
msgid "Click the actions menu for the target host"
msgstr "Clique no menu de ações do host de destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:19
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Enter Maintenance Mode`"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`Enter Maintenance Mode`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:20
msgid "|morpheus| begins the automated evacuation process"
msgstr "O |morpheus| inicia o processo automatizado de evacuação"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:22
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:104
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:154
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:22
msgid ""
"Maintenance mode can also be entered from ``Infrastructure > Clusters > "
"[Cluster] > Hosts > [Host] > Actions > Enter Maintenance Mode``."
msgstr "O modo de manutenção também pode ser iniciado em ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Hosts > [Host] > Actions > Enter Maintenance Mode``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:25
msgid "Automated Evacuation Process"
msgstr "Processo Automatizado de Evacuação"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:27
msgid "When maintenance mode is initiated, |morpheus| performs the following:"
msgstr "Quando o modo de manutenção é iniciado, o |morpheus| executa o seguinte:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Capacity validation (dry run)** — Before moving any VMs, |morpheus| "
"verifies that remaining hosts have sufficient memory to accommodate all "
"VMs. The system ensures no host exceeds 95% projected memory utilization "
"after receiving migrated VMs. If capacity is insufficient, maintenance "
"mode is refused with an error."
msgstr "**Validação de capacidade (dry run)** — Antes de mover qualquer VM, o |morpheus| verifica se os hosts restantes têm memória suficiente para acomodar todas as VMs. O sistema garante que nenhum host exceda 95% de utilização projetada de memória após receber as VMs migradas. Se a capacidade for insuficiente, o modo de manutenção é recusado com um erro."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:31
msgid ""
"**VM iteration** — VMs are processed in descending order by memory "
"allocation (largest VMs first)."
msgstr "**Iteração de VMs** — As VMs são processadas em ordem decrescente de alocação de memória (maiores VMs primeiro)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:33
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Target host selection** — For each VM, |morpheus| selects a target host"
" with the most available memory that can accommodate the VM without "
"exceeding 95% utilization."
msgstr "**Seleção do host de destino** — Para cada VM, o |morpheus| seleciona um host de destino com a maior memória disponível que possa acomodar a VM sem exceder 95% de utilização."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Live migration** — Running VMs on shared storage are live-migrated (no "
"downtime). Each migration is retried up to 3 times on failure, with a "
"15-second pause between attempts."
msgstr "**Live migration** — VMs em execução em armazenamento compartilhado são migradas a quente (sem downtime). Cada migração é tentada novamente até 3 vezes em caso de falha, com uma pausa de 15 segundos entre as tentativas."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Cold migration** — Powered-off VMs are cold-moved (XML definition "
"relocated)."
msgstr "**Cold migration** — VMs desligadas são movidas a frio (definição XML realocada)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Status update** — Once all eligible VMs are evacuated, the host status "
"changes from ``maintenancing`` to ``maintenance``."
msgstr "**Atualização de status** — Quando todas as VMs elegíveis são evacuadas, o status do host muda de ``maintenancing`` para ``maintenance``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:42
msgid "VMs Skipped During Evacuation"
msgstr "VMs Ignoradas Durante a Evacuação"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:44
msgid "The following VMs are not moved during maintenance evacuation:"
msgstr "As seguintes VMs não são movidas durante a evacuação de manutenção:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:50
msgid "VM Type"
msgstr "Tipo de VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:51
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Motivo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:52
msgid "Pinned VMs (system servers with ``pinned`` placement strategy)"
msgstr "VMs pinned (servidores de sistema com estratégia de placement ``pinned``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:53
msgid ""
"These are explicitly bound to the host and cannot be automatically "
"relocated"
msgstr "Essas VMs estão explicitamente vinculadas ao host e não podem ser realocadas automaticamente"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:54
msgid "Powered-off VMs (when ``movePoweredOff`` is disabled)"
msgstr "VMs desligadas (quando ``movePoweredOff`` está desativado)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:55
msgid "Powered-off VMs do not consume runtime resources; moving them is optional"
msgstr "VMs desligadas não consomem recursos em tempo de execução; movê-las é opcional"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:56
msgid "VMs with unknown power state"
msgstr "VMs com estado de energia desconhecido"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:57
msgid "Cannot safely determine migration path"
msgstr "Não é possível determinar com segurança o caminho de migração"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:58
msgid "VMs with local storage (while powered on)"
msgstr "VMs com armazenamento local (enquanto ligadas)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:59
msgid "Local storage cannot be live-migrated; VM must be powered off first"
msgstr "O armazenamento local não pode sofrer live migration; a VM deve ser desligada primeiro"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:61
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:141
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Alerta"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:61
msgid ""
"If pinned VMs exist on the host, they will remain in place during "
"maintenance. Ensure these VMs can tolerate the host being serviced, or "
"manually relocate them before entering maintenance mode."
msgstr "Se existirem VMs pinned no host, elas permanecerão no lugar durante a manutenção. Garanta que essas VMs possam tolerar a manutenção do host ou realoque-as manualmente antes de entrar no modo de manutenção."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:63
msgid ""
"For permanent decommissioning, maintenance mode is only the evacuation "
"step. Complete the supported cluster removal and post-removal health "
"checks in :doc:`managing_hosts`."
msgstr "Para descomissionamento permanente, o modo de manutenção é apenas a etapa de evacuação. Conclua a remoção suportada do cluster e as verificações de status pós-remoção em :doc:`managing_hosts`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:66
msgid "VMs With Local Storage"
msgstr "VMs com Armazenamento Local"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:68
msgid ""
"VMs that have volumes on local datastores cannot be live-migrated. These "
"VMs must be powered off before the host enters maintenance mode. If a "
"running VM has local storage, maintenance mode will report a failure for "
"that VM and continue with the remaining VMs."
msgstr "VMs que têm volumes em datastores locais não podem sofrer live migration. Essas VMs devem ser desligadas antes que o host entre no modo de manutenção. Se uma VM em execução tiver armazenamento local, o modo de manutenção reportará uma falha para essa VM e continuará com as VMs restantes."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:70
msgid "To handle VMs with local storage:"
msgstr "Para lidar com VMs com armazenamento local:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:72
msgid "Power off the VM manually before initiating maintenance mode"
msgstr "Desligue a VM manualmente antes de iniciar o modo de manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:73
msgid ""
"Or move the VM's storage to a shared datastore before initiating "
"maintenance mode"
msgstr "Ou mova o armazenamento da VM para um datastore compartilhado antes de iniciar o modo de manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:76
msgid "Capacity Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos de Capacidade"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:78
msgid "Maintenance mode requires that remaining hosts can absorb the workload:"
msgstr "O modo de manutenção exige que os hosts restantes possam absorver a carga de trabalho:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:80
msgid ""
"Each target host must have available memory greater than the VM's "
"allocated memory"
msgstr "Cada host de destino deve ter memória disponível maior que a memória alocada da VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:81
msgid "Projected utilization on the target host must remain below 95%"
msgstr "A utilização projetada no host de destino deve permanecer abaixo de 95%"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:82
msgid "If no host has sufficient capacity for a given VM, the operation fails"
msgstr "Se nenhum host tiver capacidade suficiente para uma determinada VM, a operação falha"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:84
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:84
msgid ""
"Plan cluster sizing with N+1 capacity to always allow at least one host "
"to enter maintenance. See :doc:`capacity_planning` for sizing guidance."
msgstr "Planeje o dimensionamento do cluster com capacidade N+1 para sempre permitir que pelo menos um host entre em manutenção. Consulte :doc:`capacity_planning` para orientação de dimensionamento."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:87
msgid "Exiting Maintenance Mode"
msgstr "Saindo do Modo de Manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:93
msgid "Click the actions menu for the host in maintenance"
msgstr "Clique no menu de ações do host em manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:94
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Exit Maintenance Mode`"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`Exit Maintenance Mode`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:97
msgid "What Happens"
msgstr "O Que Acontece"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:99
msgid "The host status changes from ``maintenance`` to ``provisioned``"
msgstr "O status do host muda de ``maintenance`` para ``provisioned``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:100
msgid "The host's maintenance mode flag is cleared"
msgstr "O sinalizador de modo de manutenção do host é limpo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:101
msgid "Stat collection and quorum participation resume immediately"
msgstr "A coleta de estatísticas e a participação no quorum são retomadas imediatamente"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:102
msgid "VMs are **not** automatically moved back to the host"
msgstr "As VMs **não** são movidas de volta automaticamente para o host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:104
msgid ""
"After exiting maintenance mode, VMs remain on their current hosts. Use "
"Dynamic Placement or manual migration to rebalance workloads if desired."
msgstr "Após sair do modo de manutenção, as VMs permanecem em seus hosts atuais. Use Dynamic Placement ou migração manual para rebalancear as cargas de trabalho, se desejar."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:107
msgid "Planned vs. Unplanned Host Absence"
msgstr "Ausência Planejada vs. Não Planejada de Host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:113
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Aspecto"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:114
msgid "Planned (Maintenance Mode)"
msgstr "Planejada (Modo de Manutenção)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:115
msgid "Unplanned (Host Failure)"
msgstr "Não Planejada (Falha de Host)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:116
msgid "VM evacuation"
msgstr "Evacuação de VMs"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:117
msgid "Live migration before host goes offline"
msgstr "Live migration antes de o host ficar offline"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:118
msgid "VMs lost; restarted on surviving hosts after 140s"
msgstr "VMs perdidas; reiniciadas nos hosts sobreviventes após 140s"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:119
msgid "Quorum impact"
msgstr "Impacto no quorum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:120
msgid "Host remains a quorum member (maintenance flag)"
msgstr "O host permanece membro do quorum (sinalizador de manutenção)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:121
msgid "Host becomes unreachable; counted against quorum"
msgstr "O host fica unreachable; contado contra o quorum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:122
msgid "Data integrity"
msgstr "Integridade dos dados"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:123
msgid "Clean unmount of shared storage"
msgstr "Desmontagem limpa do armazenamento compartilhado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:124
msgid "Fencing protects storage; DLM coordinates"
msgstr "O fencing protege o armazenamento; o DLM coordena"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:125
msgid "VM downtime"
msgstr "Downtime das VMs"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:126
msgid "Zero (live migration)"
msgstr "Zero (live migration)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:127
msgid "140+ seconds (failover timeline)"
msgstr "140+ segundos (linha do tempo de failover)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:128
msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "Recuperação"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:129
msgid "Exit maintenance mode"
msgstr "Sair do modo de manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:130
msgid "Host rejoins automatically on reboot"
msgstr "O host volta a participar automaticamente no reboot"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:133
msgid "Proper Shutdown Sequence"
msgstr "Sequência Adequada de Desligamento"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:135
msgid "To cleanly shut down a host without triggering failover:"
msgstr "Para desligar um host de forma limpa sem acionar failover:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:137
msgid "Enter maintenance mode (evacuates VMs)"
msgstr "Entre no modo de manutenção (evacua as VMs)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:138
msgid "Wait for evacuation to complete (host status shows ``maintenance``)"
msgstr "Aguarde a conclusão da evacuação (o status do host mostra ``maintenance``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:139
msgid "Power off or reboot the host for servicing"
msgstr "Desligue ou reinicie o host para a manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:141
msgid ""
"Do NOT power off a host without first entering maintenance mode. An "
"abrupt power-off will be interpreted as a host failure, triggering quorum"
" evaluation and VM failover after 140 seconds."
msgstr "NÃO desligue um host sem antes entrar no modo de manutenção. Um desligamento abrupto será interpretado como falha de host, acionando a avaliação de quorum e o failover de VMs após 140 segundos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:144
msgid "Re-joining After Maintenance"
msgstr "Reingresso Após a Manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:146
msgid "When a host boots back up after maintenance:"
msgstr "Quando um host volta a inicializar após a manutenção:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:148
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| agent starts and reads ``.quorum-nodes`` from ``/opt"
"/morpheus-node``"
msgstr "O agente |morpheus| inicia e lê ``.quorum-nodes`` em ``/opt/morpheus-node``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:149
msgid "The agent resumes peer-to-peer quorum pinging on port 7443"
msgstr "O agente retoma o ping de quorum peer-to-peer na porta 7443"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:150
msgid "Other cluster agents detect the returning host as reachable"
msgstr "Outros agentes do cluster detectam o host que retorna como reachable"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:151
msgid "Quorum status updates to include the returning host"
msgstr "O status do quorum é atualizado para incluir o host que retorna"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:152
msgid ""
"The host is available to receive VMs (via Dynamic Placement, manual "
"migration, or new provisioning)"
msgstr "O host fica disponível para receber VMs (via Dynamic Placement, migração manual ou novo provisionamento)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:154
msgid ""
"If the host was offline for less than 140 seconds and did not enter "
"maintenance mode, no VM failover occurs. The host simply rejoins the "
"quorum cycle transparently."
msgstr "Se o host ficou offline por menos de 140 segundos e não entrou no modo de manutenção, nenhum failover de VM ocorre. O host simplesmente volta ao ciclo de quorum de forma transparente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:157
msgid "Maintenance During Cluster Updates"
msgstr "Manutenção Durante Atualizações do Cluster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:159
msgid ""
"When performing rolling cluster updates (see :doc:`upgrading`), "
"|morpheus| automatically enters and exits maintenance mode for each host "
"as part of the update process. A Dynamic Placement lock is acquired "
"during maintenance to prevent resource scheduling from interfering with "
"the update cycle."
msgstr "Ao realizar atualizações rolling do cluster (consulte :doc:`upgrading`), o |morpheus| entra e sai automaticamente do modo de manutenção para cada host como parte do processo de atualização. Um bloqueio de Dynamic Placement é adquirido durante a manutenção para impedir que o agendamento de recursos interfira no ciclo de atualização."

